<mxCell id="fn1" value="BOM/Recipe (pp_boms/pp_recipes, blue) moved here from an earlier MES-owned draft — see PP_SPECS.md §3D and §7, and MES_SPECS.md §3B&#39;s boundary note. INVENTORY.products FKs are real (Inventory is present on every plan today); every MES.* pointer is informational only, because MES_SPECS.md is spec-only — no MES tables exist in this database yet. Wide tables (pp_item_planning_params, pp_planned_orders) compact several related columns onto one row for legibility; the authoritative column list is PP_SPECS.sql." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4A5563;align=left;fontStyle=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1454" width="1820" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
